s due to what you believe being true.<br /> <br /> Changelings state the Tuatha De Daanan and Formori are the supreme deities of the world because they are the original incarnations of dream and nightmare.<br /> <br /> Wraith explicitly makes it clear there is no Heaven for the majority of beings, just the Far Shores.<br /> <br /> And YEC isn't even true in DEMON: THE FALLEN. Demons routinely discuss events happening millions and billions of years ago. Not that the majority of Abrahamic faiths believe in YEC either but that's separate.<br /> <br /> We also know its wrong in other lines because the Mokole remember back millions of years.<br /> <br /> These are not small details.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You are correct in that I shouldn't have mentioned Young in the Creationism. On the Black Furies: they are shown to be wrong. The Patriach is an umbrood, and they came after creation, same with Changelings, Wraith makes it clear the Far Shores are..unknown, they might be heaven, they might be reincarnation, no one knows (unless I missed that source book, which may very well be true). Though as we don't know what state the other game lines lore will emerge in, if they emerge at all, all we have is V5s return to the OG VtM position of: Abrahamic religions right, all others wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-31T06:51:22-07:00","id":1466004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <st