rum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465967-spoilers-la-by-night-ending-a-k-a-the-state-of-la-in-the-wod?p=1466130#post1466130\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I would say that Kindred aren't necessarily so tainted but...<br /> <br /> There is no Kuei-Jin anymore. I don't think there are Beast Courts, either.</div> </div> </div> </div>That'd be a big change that made it so that Garou arguably screwed up even worse during the War of Rage (if the Nation is fully worldwide) and require some other method of playing Nagah more openly.<br /> <br /> Hopefully, they don't start striking out breeds of Fera while they're at it.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-01T23:29:51-07:00","id":1466229,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465967-spoilers-la-by-night-ending-a-k-a-the-state-of-la-in-the-wod?p=1466220#post1466220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hopefully, they don't start striking out breeds of Fera while they're at it.</div> </div> </div> </div>You think there will still be Fera? I'd lay better than even odds that they are going in the Antagonist-Only bin. And even that book will be at least a few years down the track.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-01T23:36:13-07:00","id":1466230,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1465967-spoilers-la-by-night-ending-a-k-a-the-state-of-la-in-the-wod?p=1466107#post1466107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mind you, I am now curious if there's a Chinese equivalent to Pentex.</div> </div> </div> </div>Based on the number of Fomori/Bakemono/Mockeries mentioned as being a, government acknowledged, part of the PLA that equivalent would seem to be the CCP. Which kind of makes sense as all corporations within China are essentially semi-autonomous arms of the government anyway, in practical terms at least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://